    {
      "source": "Creates a new instance of the <a href=\"DefaultScopedObject.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.scope\"><code>DefaultScopedObject</code></a> class.",
      "translation": "创建 `<a href=\"DefaultScopedObject.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.scope\"><code>DefaultScopedObject</code></a>` 类的新实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Simply delegates the calls to the underlying\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/ConfigurableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>bean factory</code></a>\n(<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html#getBean(java.lang.String)\"><code>BeanFactory.getBean(String)</code></a>/\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/ConfigurableBeanFactory.html#destroyScopedBean(java.lang.String)\"><code>ConfigurableBeanFactory.destroyScopedBean(String)</code></a>).",
      "translation": "Simply delegates the calls to the underlying\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/ConfigurableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>bean factory</code></a>\n(<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html#getBean(java.lang.String)\"><code>BeanFactory.getBean(String)</code></a>/\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/ConfigurableBeanFactory.html#destroyScopedBean(java.lang.String)\"><code>ConfigurableBeanFactory.destroyScopedBean(String)</code></a>).",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The raw target object can for example be passed to persistence\nproviders which would not be able to handle the scoped proxy object.",
      "translation": "原始目标对象可以传递给无法处理作用域代理对象的持久化提供者。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that no further calls may be made to the scoped object\nafterwards (at least within the current thread, that is, with\nthe exact same target object in the target scope).",
      "translation": "注意，在此之后（至少在当前线程中，即针对目标作用域中的完全相同的目标对象）不得再向该作用域对象发出调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
