      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - the <a href=\"../../beans/factory/config/ConfigurableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableBeanFactory</code></a> that holds the scoped target object",
