      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the current target object behind this scoped object proxy,\nin its raw form (as stored in the target scope).",
      "translation": "返回此作用域对象代理背后的当前目标对象，以原始形式（即存储在其目标作用域中的形式）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Remove this object from its target scope, for example from\nthe backing session.",
      "translation": "从目标范围（例如后端会话）中移除此对象。",
